<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Noble Affiliates started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Noble Affiliates started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it initiated coverage of Noble Affiliates Inc with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- said stock appears undervalued on a cash flow basis.</p>
<p>-- said Noble has a well-diversified exploration progam. The company's production is expected to increase 28 percent in 1997 and five percent in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said Noble has very strong reserve replacement rate, which is a &quot;significant factor in determining the company's operational success.&quot;</p>
</text>
